#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/storage.md:10
msgid "Block media, Flash and memory access"
msgstr "块介质、Flash 与内存访问"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/storage.md:12
msgid ""
"Block sessions, SDIO functions, Flash maintenance and memory-window access "
"are distinct capabilities. Products own partitions, media policy, recovery "
"and permanent startup reservations."
msgstr "块会话、SDIO function、Flash 维护和内存窗口访问是独立能力。产品负责分区、介质策略、恢复及永久启动预留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/storage.md:16
msgid ""
"Media activation, function selection, memory-window leases and permanent "
"startup backing are distinct operations. A block session does not turn an "
"SDIO function into sector media. A CPU-window lease grants only its declared"
" bank access; startup backing remains held while its static objects exist. "
"See [physical storage](../../contracts/io/f4-flash-storage.md) and "
"[FSMC](../../contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md) before selecting those "
"interfaces."
msgstr ""
"介质激活、function 选择、存储窗口 lease 与永久启动后备存储是不同操作。块会话不把 SDIO function 转为扇区介质。CPU "
"window lease 只授予声明的 bank "
"访问；启动后备存储在静态对象存续期间始终被持有。选择这些接口前先读[物理存储](../../contracts/io/f4-flash-"
"storage.md)与 [FSMC](../../contracts/io/f4-external-memory.md) 合同。"

